sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant DocumentationController
    participant ChatClient
    participant Ollama
    participant DocumentationTools
    participant Repository as Repository filesystem

    Client->>DocumentationController: POST /api/agent/document
    DocumentationController->>ChatClient: prompt().user(DOC_INSTRUCTION)
    ChatClient->>Ollama: Ask model to execute documentation workflow

    Ollama-->>ChatClient: Call scanForMissingJavadoc()
    ChatClient->>DocumentationTools: scanForMissingJavadoc()
    DocumentationTools->>Repository: Walk .java files under configured root
    Repository-->>DocumentationTools: Missing Javadoc report
    DocumentationTools-->>ChatClient: Report

    loop For each reported file
        Ollama-->>ChatClient: Call readJavaFile(relativePath)
        ChatClient->>DocumentationTools: readJavaFile(relativePath)
        DocumentationTools->>Repository: Read file
        Repository-->>DocumentationTools: File content
        DocumentationTools-->>ChatClient: File content

        Ollama-->>ChatClient: Call writeJavaFile(relativePath, content)
        ChatClient->>DocumentationTools: writeJavaFile(relativePath, content)
        DocumentationTools->>Repository: Overwrite .java file
        Repository-->>DocumentationTools: Write complete
        DocumentationTools-->>ChatClient: Write status
    end

    Ollama-->>ChatClient: Summary of documented files
    ChatClient-->>DocumentationController: Summary
    DocumentationController-->>Client: {summary}
